{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10015","headline":"战城南 · 徐九臯","name":"战城南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"塞北狂胡旅，城南敌汉围。\n巉岩一鼓气，拔利五兵威。\n虏骑瞻山哭，王师拓地飞。\n不应须宠战，当遂勒金徽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐九臯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10015.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10015","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}